<title>JAPAN: Miura Co to buy back 840,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Miura Co to buy back 840,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miura Co Ltd said on Monday that it was planning to buy back 840,000 of its common shares in order to implement a stock option plan.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of industrial boilers said in a statement that it would buy the shares back at 1,500 yen per share.</p>
<p>It will spend up to 1.5 billion yen to buy back the shares during the August 5-25 period, it added.</p>
</text>
